{
  "about": "Deterministic layer choices for the LPC hero sheets (#789): one sheet per class and people (data/races.js; `@head` is the people's head family, `@hair` its hair colour, and `skin` the LPC body and head skin, each picked by eye as the nearest to the people's first skin and hair colour in data/races.js; Warband peoples are green, Concord peoples human tones), composed by scripts/art/lpc-heroes.mjs from the Universal LPC Spritesheet Character Generator's layers. `def` is a sheet_definitions name, `variant` its colour or material, `tint` recolours that layer to the faction key ramp (the tabard). Frames: generator walk rows (8 up, 9 left, 10 down, 11 right) in our order down, left, right, up; columns 0 (stand), 3 and 7 (the two stride poses); crop is the top-left of the 32x48 window in the 64x64 frame.",
